+//   index 56-63:  MCS 8-15, short guard interval, 40 MHz channel
+// and send packets at a high rate using each MCS, using the SpectrumWifiPhy
+// and the NistErrorRateModel, at a distance of 1 meter.  The program outputs
+// results such as:
